abstract: "Reproducible Bayesian inference pipeline for cosmic curvature and galaxy-scale strong-lens mass-density slope evolution with full Type Ia supernova covariance, two-stage MILP tracer assignment (CosmoMatcher v1.4.3), nonlinear latent-modulus marginalization, posterior-predictive diagnostics, and fixed-design known-truth simulations."
